                <pb facs="0155" n="47" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg47"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio
                                de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-09-11"><hi rendition="#italic">September 11,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson reports that martial law has been declared and that commerce and
                    trade are suspended.</p>
